{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Autonomous AI data analyst agents require two core capabilities when interacting with private local data:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sandboxed Code & Command Execution","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Safely filtering, grouping, projecting, and transforming tabular datasets without executing arbitrary unvetted shell scripts or system processes.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Token-Efficient Context Summarization"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Compressing high-dimensional tables into structured, dense Markdown schema summaries that fit comfortably within LLM context windows.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiftAgent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" provides "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to bridge on-device large language models (","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftLLM","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") with the native performance of "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/nodibell.github.io\/SwiftSci\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"code":["graph TD","    UserQuery[User Analytics Query] --> LLM[Local LLM Agent \/ ReAct Engine]","    DF[(SwiftDataFrame In-Memory Table)] --> RAGGen[RAGContextGenerator]","    RAGGen --> PromptCtx[Markdown Dataset Profile]","    PromptCtx --> LLM","    LLM --> DSLCommand[Generated DSL Command e.g. 'filter age > 30']","    DSLCommand --> Evaluator[SwiftAgentEvaluator Actor]","    DF --> Evaluator","    Evaluator --> TransformedDF[Transformed DataFrame Output]","    Evaluator --> LineageRecord[Lineage Record Audit Trail]","    TransformedDF --> LLMResponse[Agent Synthesizes Final Answer]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"mermaid"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"1. Sandboxed REPL & DSL Command Evaluation","anchor":"1-Sandboxed-REPL--DSL-Command-Evaluation","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor-isolated engine that parses and executes high-level DSL commands on a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DataFrame"},{"type":"text","text":". Unlike raw interpreter bridges, it evaluates operations through a strongly typed AST (Abstract Syntax Tree), ensuring that memory safety, thread isolation, and data invariants are strictly preserved."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Supported-DSL-Operations","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Supported DSL Operations"},{"alignments":["left","left","left","left"],"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Command Pattern","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Example Expression","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"AST Case","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Filter"}]}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"filter Age > 30.0\"","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".filter(column, condition)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Evaluates scalar thresholds ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":">"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":">=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"<=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"==","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"!=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Select","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"select Product, Price\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".select(columns)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Projects specific column subsets."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"GroupBy","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"groupby Category mean Price\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".groupBy(column, agg, target)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computes aggregations ("},{"code":"mean","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"sum","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"min","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"max","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sample","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"sample 50\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".sample(n)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Randomly samples rows deterministically."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Head \/ Tail"}],"type":"strong"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"head 10\""},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"tail 5\"","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".head(n)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":".tail(n)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Slices initial or trailing records."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Null Handling","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"dropNulls\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"\"fillNulls Fare 0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".dropNulls","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":".fillNulls","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cleans or imputes missing scalar entries.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"anchor":"Execution-Example","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Execution Example"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import SwiftDataFrame","import SwiftAgent","","\/\/ 1. Initialize DataFrame","let rawDF = DataFrame(columns: [","    TypedColumn(name: \"Department\", values: [\"Sales\", \"Engineering\", \"Sales\", \"Support\", \"Engineering\"]),","    TypedColumn(name: \"Salary\", values: [75000.0, 120000.0, 82000.0, 58000.0, 135000.0]),","    TypedColumn(name: \"TenureYears\", values: [3, 5, 4, 1, 7])","])","","\/\/ 2. Initialize actor evaluator","let evaluator = SwiftAgentEvaluator()","","\/\/ 3. Execute sandboxed transformations","let highEarners = try await evaluator.evaluate(","    command: \"filter Salary >= 80000.0\",","    on: rawDF",")","","let departmentSummary = try await evaluator.evaluate(","    command: \"groupby Department mean Salary\",","    on: highEarners",")","","print(departmentSummary.summary())"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"2. Lineage Tracking & Immutable Audit Trails","anchor":"2-Lineage-Tracking--Immutable-Audit-Trails","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When autonomous agents transform datasets over iterative multi-turn dialogues, tracking the provenance and step-by-step delta of the data is critical for compliance and verification."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically captures each successful transformation as an immutable "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Inspect the execution trajectory","let auditTrail = await evaluator.lineage","","for record in auditTrail {","    print(\"\"\"","    [Step \\(record.stepIndex)] \\(record.operation)","      • Rows: \\(record.inputRows) -> \\(record.outputRows)","      • Executed At: \\(record.timestamp)","    \"\"\")","}","","\/\/ Reset trajectory between separate user tasks","await evaluator.clearLineage()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"level":2,"anchor":"3-Tabular-RAG-Context-Summarization","type":"heading","text":"3. Tabular RAG Context Summarization"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Large datasets cannot be pasted verbatim into an LLM context window without incurring prohibitive attention computation and context exhaustion. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" extracts metadata, column typings, and dimensional boundaries to produce token-efficient Markdown profiles for prompt injection:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let contextGen = RAGContextGenerator()","let markdownProfile = contextGen.generateSummary(df: rawDF, name: \"EmployeePayroll\")","","print(markdownProfile)","\/\/ Output:","\/\/ ## EmployeePayroll Profile","\/\/ - Rows: 5, Columns: 3","\/\/ - Columns: Department, Salary, TenureYears"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inject this profile directly into your system prompt so the language model understands available columns and schema constraints before generating transformation instructions."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"4. End-to-End LLM Function Calling & ReAct Integration","anchor":"4-End-to-End-LLM-Function-Calling--ReAct-Integration","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Combine ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"SwiftLLM","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to construct an autonomous tabular analyst:"}]},{"code":["import SwiftAgent","import SwiftDataFrame","","public struct TabularAnalystTool: Sendable {","    private let evaluator: SwiftAgentEvaluator","    private var currentDataFrame: DataFrame","","    public init(df: DataFrame) {","        self.evaluator = SwiftAgentEvaluator()","        self.currentDataFrame = df","    }","","    \/\/\/ Tool invocation callback conforming to ReActAgent tool schema","    public mutating func execute(command: String) async throws -> String {","        let transformed = try await evaluator.evaluate(command: command, on: currentDataFrame)","        self.currentDataFrame = transformed","        return \"Command succeeded. Result dimensions: \\(transformed.rowCount) rows x \\(transformed.columnNames.count) columns.\"","    }","","    public func datasetContext() -> String {","        RAGContextGenerator().generateSummary(df: currentDataFrame, name: \"ActiveWorkspace\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"5. Safe Error Handling & Guardrails","anchor":"5-Safe-Error-Handling--Guardrails","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The evaluation sandbox rejects unparseable strings, missing columns, or type mismatches early, throwing structured ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" instances:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["do {","    let result = try await evaluator.evaluate(command: \"filter NonExistentCol > 10\", on: rawDF)","} catch let AgentError.unparseable(cmd) {","    print(\"Agent emitted an invalid DSL syntax: \\(cmd)\")","} catch let AgentError.executionFailed(reason) {","    print(\"Execution rejected: \\(reason)\")","} catch {","    print(\"Unexpected error: \\(error)\")","}"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Execute dynamic Swift expressions in a sandboxed evaluation engine, trace immutable lineage audit trails, and summarize tabular DataFrame context for local LLM agents.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"SwiftAgent"}],"title":"Safe Swift REPL & RAG Context Generator","role":"collectionGroup"},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides & Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentCollaboration"],"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","generated":true}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Agent-Components","title":"Agent Components","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentError","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentCommand"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftagent\/agenticreplandrag"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgenticReplAndRAG"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/MultiAgentCollaboration":{"abstract":[{"text":"Orchestrate teams of specialized autonomous agents over an asynchronous message bus with concurrent parallel tool calling.","type":"text"}],"title":"Multi-Agent Coordination & Protocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentCollaboration","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/multiagentcollaboration"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/RAGContextGenerator":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RAG Context summary generator for dataframes."}],"title":"RAGContextGenerator","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RAGContextGenerator"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RAGContextGenerator"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/ragcontextgenerator"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/AgentCommand":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentCommand","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Structured Agent AST representation for sandboxed execution.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/agentcommand","title":"AgentCommand","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AgentCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AgentCommand"}]},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent":{"title":"SwiftAgent","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Agentic REPL Execution Sandbox & RAG Summary Engine."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/SwiftAgentEvaluator":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Agentic Swift Execution Sandbox Evaluator."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/swiftagentevaluator","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SwiftAgentEvaluator","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SwiftAgentEvaluator","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SwiftAgentEvaluator","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/AgentError":{"abstract":[{"text":"Errors thrown by SwiftAgent evaluation sandbox.","type":"text"}],"title":"AgentError","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/agenterror","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AgentError"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AgentError"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentError"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/LineageRecord":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LineageRecord"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LineageRecord","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Represents an immutable audit trail entry recording a discrete data transformation step.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/lineagerecord","kind":"symbol","title":"LineageRecord"},"https://nodibell.github.io/SwiftSci/documentation/swiftdataframe/":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/nodibell.github.io\/SwiftSci\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/","title":"SwiftDataFrame","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftDataFrame"}],"identifier":"https:\/